{"unit_id":"not-big-dog__DSH-pipeline-kernel#card-zh","repo":"not-big-dog/DSH-pipeline-kernel","commit":"b9506a8ca5c847230db1bdc85c47c0091ab8871f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pipeline-kernel 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的多角色任务管线管理内核。它在 DSH 注册 pipeline_* 工具和 /pipeline 命令，以 storageDomain 保存任务板、管线定义、角色会话注册表和台账。使用者可创建并部署管线、播种角色会话、投递和认领任务；完成时内核按 route 自动推进或返工，并由巡检恢复未完成路由。Web 侧栏展示活动状态、任务、管线、打包信息与归档。适合需要在多个 DSH agent 会话间编排有状态工作流的团队；安装到 DSH Web 并配置工作区即可使用，无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-77","lib/tools.js:24-600","lib/client/index.js:17-46"]}
{"unit_id":"not-big-dog__DSH-pipeline-kernel#card-en","repo":"not-big-dog/DSH-pipeline-kernel","commit":"b9506a8ca5c847230db1bdc85c47c0091ab8871f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pipeline-kernel coordinates DSH Web agent pipelines. It stores tasks, pipeline definitions, role sessions, and ledgers. Define pipelines, dispatch work, route completed tasks or rework, and recover interrupted routes. A web sidebar shows activity and archives. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-77","lib/tools.js:24-600","lib/client/index.js:17-46"]}
